---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const title = `Privacy Policy | ${SITE.name}`;
const description = 'How Secure Media Tech collects, uses and protects personal data on securemediatech.com — minimal collection, no trackers without consent, GDPR- and UAE DPL-aligned practices.';
---
<PageLayout title={title} description={description} noindex>
  <section class="py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-300">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: October 2026 · Applies to {SITE.url}</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">1. What we collect</h2>
      <p>We keep collection minimal by design. The contact form on this site does not store data on our servers: your brief is transmitted to us via WhatsApp or email only when you choose to send it. If you download the company profile or request a proposal, we hold your name, organisation, email and phone solely to respond.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">2. Analytics & cookies</h2>
      <p>This site uses essential cookies for functionality (including remembering your consent choice). Optional analytics tools (Google Analytics, Microsoft Clarity) load only after you accept, and can be refused at any time by clearing the <code class="text-green-glow">smt-cookie-consent</code> entry in your browser storage. We do not sell personal data or run advertising retargeting pixels without consent.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">3. How we use data</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>Responding to enquiries and delivering engagements</li>
        <li>Improving site performance and content relevance</li>
        <li>Meeting legal and compliance obligations (UAE Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 on Personal Data Protection)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">4. Security of your data</h2>
      <p>The same standards we sell are applied to us: encrypted transport (TLS), least-privilege access to enquiry data, retention limits, and incident response procedures tested against real-world practice.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">5. Your rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access, correction or deletion of any personal data we hold about you. Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-cyan-glow underline">{SITE.email}</a> or WhatsApp {SITE.mobileDisplay} and we will action requests within the legally required window.</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">6. Contact</h2>
      <p>{SITE.name} · {SITE.location}<br />Mobile / WhatsApp: {SITE.mobileDisplay} · Office: {SITE.officeDisplay}<br />Web: <a href={SITE.url} class="text-cyan-glow underline">{SITE.url}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
